00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.780
So no, I just mean that's not true

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:55.860
in the sense when she was a baby,

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:58.350
she actually, I was in, I
was in Scotland, I think.

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:00.060
And she, it was Ireland or Scotland.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:04.320
I can't remember where we
