00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:12.870
I don't drink champagne,

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:15.120
that's why it was left on the
table 'cause I don't drink it.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:16.260
And somebody bought it from me to be nice.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.970
She grabbed the champagne and took a sip,

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:19.242
