00:04:23.966 --> 00:04:26.100
It was a sip and I went, "What?!"

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.270
And I was like, yeah it was crazy.

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.160
- My kids have ordered non-alcoholic beers

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.270
