(Kelly laughs)

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.103
- Like a buck.

00:04:31.103 --> 00:04:33.450
- Which sounds insane if you don't know.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:34.830
'Cause context is important.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.660
We've learned that over
the last few years.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.430
- Yeah.
- So like my husband and I,

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:40.080
when we walked the babies at night

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:42.330
in our neighborhood when my
daughter was really little

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:43.920
he is a recovering addict,

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.270
but he likes non-alcoholic beers.

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:47.340
So he'd pop one open,
he'd have her on his chest

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:49.320
and we'd walk and like look at the sunset.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.750
So as a baby she was like pawing at it

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.270
and sometimes she would
like suck on the rim of it.

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:57.510
So I think it feels to her
like something special,

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:58.689
something daddy--

00:04:58.689 --> 00:04:59.522
- And they shared it.
- Something family.

00:04:59.522 --> 00:05:00.960
And we've been at restaurants--

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.626
- And there's no alcohol.
- There's no alcohol in it.

00:05:02.626 --> 00:05:04.087
So we've been at restaurants
where she's said,

00:05:04.087 --> 00:05:04.920
"Do you have anything,

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.180
"do you have any non-alcoholic beer?"

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.940
And I'm like, "Maybe,
maybe, maybe we don't."

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:11.220
We just keep that for home.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:13.200
- It's so amazing when in your own family

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.280
you're like, "This is normal."

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.757
But then you go outside and you're like,

00:05:15.757 --> 00:05:18.510
"So that maybe doesn't track as healthy."

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:19.343
- Right.
- But, it yeah.

00:05:19.343 --> 00:05:20.947
- But then I'm also sort of like,

00:05:20.947 --> 00:05:22.087
"You can judge me if you want.

00:05:22.087 --> 00:05:23.220
"I'm not doing anything wrong."

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:24.270
Like, "That's your problem."
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:25.103
Yeah, that's true, yep.

00:05:25.103 --> 00:05:26.056
Yep. That's on you.

