00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:34.590
So did you guys do like
a family thing this year

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:35.423
for Halloween?

00:05:35.423 --> 00:05:37.290
My kids are too independent.

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.296
- I don't accept that.

00:05:38.296 --> 00:05:39.129
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:05:39.129 --> 00:05:39.962
I'm sorry.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:41.633
I don't accept that.

00:05:41.633 --> 00:05:43.140
I sat my kids down,

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:46.560
like a year or two ago
and I said listen to me.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:49.590
It's very important that
we have a themed Halloween,

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:51.090
a family costume.
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:52.470
- Okay.
- It's important to me.

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:54.217
Like I basically said,

00:05:54.217 --> 00:05:56.347
"I'm trying to be vulnerable here.

00:05:56.347 --> 00:05:58.577
"It's very important to Mommy to do this."

00:05:58.577 --> 00:06:00.240
- I want to feel included.

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.073
- Yes!
- I'm apart of a team.

00:06:01.073 --> 00:06:02.340
- [Kristen] I don't wanna feel scattered.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.010
I wanna feel like a team.
- Yeah.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:05.850
- So you can do whatever
you want for school.

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:06.780
But at home,

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:09.900
