selfless and doing this

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.957
'cause it's so important to Mommy?

00:06:11.957 --> 00:06:13.680
- (laughing) The level of the shame

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.540
- I mean I know I wasn't trying to shame.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:18.037
I was trying to be vulnerable and say,

00:06:18.037 --> 00:06:19.915
"You have things that are
super important to you."

00:06:19.915 --> 00:06:20.940
(audience awws)
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.788
- [Kristen] So we did
the Sanderson Sisters.

00:06:22.788 --> 00:06:24.197
(audience cheers)
- [Kelly] I love it!

00:06:24.197 --> 00:06:25.836
- [Kristen] It was great.

00:06:25.836 --> 00:06:27.030
- [Kelly] I love it.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.830
- [Kristen] And Dax
