00:06:45.388 --> 00:06:46.300
- Have the trailer drag
everybody around, yeah.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.360
- Yeah. It's pretty fun.
- Yeah. That's so cool.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:50.730
I love that you don't see
stuff like that here in L.A.

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:51.750
I've never heard of that in L.A.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:53.370
