00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:37.560
And finally I had to like
let her figure that out.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:38.454
- I think you--

00:07:38.454 --> 00:07:39.539
- And she will limit herself a bit now,

00:07:39.539 --> 00:07:40.372
'cause she's like ugh.

00:07:40.372 --> 00:07:41.460
- I think letting them
figure it out is the,

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:43.770
