00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:48.667
and I'm like, "Okay eat.

00:07:48.667 --> 00:07:51.000
"Eat the amount of candy you
want and see how you feel."

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:51.833
- [Kelly] Yeah.

